A message from the sea, of the heart's goal;
To find balance, in the ebb and flow;
To ride the waves, of life's uncertain show.

The poem's message, a call to the heart;
To listen to the ocean, and play its part;
To find the rhythm, of the waves' sweet song;
To dance with the sea, and sing its poem all day long.

